-    For each arc (i, j), computes a conservative lower bound on the reduced
-    cost of any route traversing (i, j):
-
-        lb(i,j) = R·w_i − π_i − C·d_{ij}    (arc contribution)
-                  − C·d_{j,0}                  (cheapest return to depot)
